  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EnDev: Energy Access SME Finance Facilitator (Digital Equb)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Energy Access Small- and Medium-sized Enterprises (SMEs) Finance Facilitator aims to mobilise finance by working with financiers to develop a portfolio of viable loans for SMEs in partner countries that operate in the energy access sector.With little finance available for locally owned companies, the Energy Access SMEs Finance Facilitator aims to increase the availability of capital in difficult markets. Additionally, it seeks to increase cross-sectoral learning at a portfolio level and the possible scaling of best-case practices and insights.The project objective is to unlock equb-financing for 150 SMEs in EnDev partner country Ethiopia.</narrative>
  </description>
